==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|criminalisation}} (''mainly UK'')

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*krey-}}
{{suffix|en|criminal|ization}} or {{suffix|en|criminalize|ation}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|krĭ"mĭnəlīzā'shən}}, {{IPA|en|/ˌkɹɪmɪnəlaɪzˈeɪʃən/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The act of making a previously [[legal]] activity [[illegal]], the act of making something a criminal offence.
# The act of turning someone into a [[criminal]] by making their activities illegal.

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|decriminalization}}

